                                "sense_id": "5f5e99e2-5fe4-33ee-b56f-66516359f316",
                                "text": "I'd be wading in scummer if it wasn't for works like these. Except, of course, that nobody ever bothered to put such tunnels in the Lower City, so I do wade in scummer there."
                            },
