                                "sense_id": "5f5e99e2-5fe4-33ee-b56f-66516359f316",
                                "text": "[…] they'd moved him to a different prison - one that stank of scummer and blood and despair. He no longer dangled from the wall, but lay on a pile of filthy blankets on the stone floor. His wrists and ankles were still darbied, but the[…]"
